  "title": "Yummy Sweet Glassy Mediterranean Jelly Stew",
  "description": "A sweet and nostalgic Mediterranean dish featuring a jelly-like texture, perfect for a weeknight dinner or special occasion. This recipe uses a donabe vessel and is gluten-free friendly.",
