  "instructions": [
    "Combine rice vinegar, sugar, and dried apricots in the donabe. ",
    "In a separate bowl, mix miso paste and water until smooth. ",
    "Add the miso mixture to the donabe and stir to combine. ",
    "Pour in the dry white wine and bring the mixture to a simmer over medium heat. ",
    "Reduce heat to low and let cook for 10 minutes, or until the mixture has thickened and formed a jelly-like texture. ",
    "Stir in chopped fresh mint and salt. ",
    "Serve warm or at room temperature.",
    "Let cool completely before refrigerating or freezing. ",
    "Reheat gently before serving.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional fresh mint if desired."
  ],
